#+TITLE: Beacon launch readiness
#+SUBTITLE: A local, reproducible view over project data

* Weekly activation

This materialized view keeps the query result, freshness metadata, and chart definition beside the launch notes that use it. Refreshing the data is explicit; reading the document does not contact an external service.

#+query-data: result=weekly_activation rows=5 ran_at=2026-06-15T16:30:00Z freshness=24h source_hash=demo
#+name: weekly_activation
| week | activated_teams |
|------+-----------------|
|    1 |              18 |
|    2 |              31 |
|    3 |              47 |
|    4 |              62 |
|    5 |              78 |

#+name: weekly_activation_chart
```chart line
title: Activated teams by beta week
x: week
y: activated_teams
source: weekly_activation
height: 240
```

* Launch blockers

#+name: blockers_by_area
| area        | open_blockers |
|-------------+---------------|
| Onboarding  |             2 |
| Data import |             1 |
| Docs        |             3 |
| Support     |             1 |

#+name: blockers_chart
```chart bar
title: Open blockers by area
x: area
y: open_blockers
source: blockers_by_area
height: 260
```
